"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:656250a4-3e73-45c1-a9b9-1efc1fca9b8a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:656250a4-3e73-45c1-a9b9-1efc1fca9b8a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the table <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-243&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-53</span> in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/25px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/38px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/50px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Jannath's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png/25px-Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Fireliia_Jannath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fireliia_Jannath\" title=\"Fireliia Jannath\">Lady Jannath's</a> bedroom in <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My darling daughter\n</p><p><br>\nI hope life as a newly-wed is all you hoped it would be. Life in the Upper City is pleasant as ever - the flowers in the garden are blooming beautifully, though not a patch on your bouquet.\n</p><p><br>\nI do hope you'll visit soon - it's been far too long. Come any time, and stay as long as you wish.\n</p><p><br>\nWith much love, as always\n</p><p>Mother\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062520\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1874/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29561/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8249/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935394/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.535      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.535      1 -total\n 59.96%   27.305      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.64%   24.426     19 Template:Trim\n 32.75%   14.912      1 Template:PageSeo\n 32.62%   14.853      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.80%   11.750      2 Template:CharLink\n 25.49%   11.606      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.51%    9.795      2 Template:Uid\n 20.39%    9.283      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35699-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062520 and revision id 377894. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}